  #line-at(223.61pt, 502.27pt, "/6 respectively. Beyond these limits, the contact line de-pins ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 523.27pt, "with complex stick-slip behavior as reported in previous studies [17, 20, 28, 29]. ")
